## Critical zombie infection - private popups shown only to the infected player, getting worse over time.

critical-zombie-infection-early-1 = Your limbs feel heavy. You let them hang.
critical-zombie-infection-early-2 = Your mouth waters for no reason at all.
critical-zombie-infection-early-3 = Something itches under your skin. Deep under.
critical-zombie-infection-early-4 = The lights feel far too bright today.
critical-zombie-infection-early-5 = You catch yourself staring at someone's head. Just for a moment.
critical-zombie-infection-early-6 = Your heartbeat sounds... slower.
critical-zombie-infection-early-7 = You can't remember the last time you blinked.
critical-zombie-infection-early-8 = Food smells wrong. Everything smells wrong.

critical-zombie-infection-middle-1 = You wonder what brains taste like.
critical-zombie-infection-middle-2 = Your fingers twitch on their own.
critical-zombie-infection-middle-3 = Your skin feels cold and loose, like borrowed clothing.
critical-zombie-infection-middle-4 = The crowd sounds less like people and more like dinner.
critical-zombie-infection-middle-5 = You bite your tongue. It doesn't hurt. You keep chewing.
critical-zombie-infection-middle-6 = A low groan slips out of you before you can stop it.
critical-zombie-infection-middle-7 = Your thoughts are getting slow... and hungry.
critical-zombie-infection-middle-8 = Your gums ache. Your teeth want something soft.

critical-zombie-infection-late-1 = BRAINS. No, wait. What were you thinking about?
critical-zombie-infection-late-2 = You can hear their hearts beating. So loud. So warm.
critical-zombie-infection-late-3 = Your name is slipping away. It doesn't matter.
critical-zombie-infection-late-4 = The hunger is the only thing left that makes sense.
critical-zombie-infection-late-5 = Your jaw clenches and unclenches on its own.
critical-zombie-infection-late-6 = Everyone looks so... soft.
critical-zombie-infection-late-7 = Your body moves before you tell it to.
critical-zombie-infection-late-8 = It would be so easy to just let go.

# Shared by every stage.
critical-zombie-infection-twitch = Your muscles involuntarily twitch.

critical-zombie-infection-examine-far = [color=#9fb88a]{CAPITALIZE(SUBJECT($target))} {CONJUGATE-BE($target)} looking awfully pale.[/color]
critical-zombie-infection-examine-close = [color=#9fb88a]{CAPITALIZE(SUBJECT($target))} {CONJUGATE-BE($target)} deathly pale, and {POSS-ADJ($target)} muscles keep twitching.[/color]

critical-zombie-infection-final =Your vision floods red. The hunger takes you.
critical-zombie-infection-cured = The gnawing hunger fades. Your thoughts are your own again.
